{"id":"656361","name":"冬笋炒腊肉","author":"哲妈——爱生活爱家人爱厨房","authorId":"11472081","desc":"","cover":"images/656361/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腊肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腊肉洗净，放入锅中煮30分钟，捞出切片。","img":"images/656361/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冬笋切片，焯水2分钟。","img":"images/656361/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒入少许食用油烧热，放入腊肉翻炒几下。","img":"images/656361/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入蒜片、干辣椒，继续翻炒至肥肉出油。","img":"images/656361/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入笋片继续翻炒2分钟左右。","img":"images/656361/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"撒上葱花。","img":"images/656361/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/656361/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}